.TH TALONS 1
.SH NAME
talons \- fishing flight game
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/talons
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Talons
is a fishing flight game.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Steer a low flight with wasd or the arrows and catch fish while avoiding birds.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B Left / a
Turn left
.TP
.B Right / d
Turn right
.TP
.B Up / w
Increase speed
.TP
.B Down / s
Decrease speed
.TP
.B Enter / r
Restart
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/talons.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR draw3d (2),
.IR tone (2),
.IR wm (1)
